+  selected date, the Cedar Room, 5:30 doors, and available access features.
+- **October 6 (two weeks before):** publish the newsletter announcement; Jordan
+  also confirms the selected hold, layout, and onsite contact with the library.
+  Do not advertise the city liaison, captioning provider, food, or photography
+  as confirmed unless those uncertainties have been closed.
+- **October 13 (one week before):** Casey obtains slides and checks their format;
