+  participant briefing, and the owners of any remaining decisions.
+- **October 18 (48 hours before):** Jordan sends family-table instructions and
+  the final run sheet; Casey confirms the AV and accessibility checklist; Robin
+  receives final opening and closing notes; Sam receives the breakout prompt.
+- **Event day:** Jordan circulates only changes that affect execution, and each
+  owner acknowledges their assignment before the 5:15 p.m. room check.
